  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<article>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f209374400-3c486618-81ef-4d34-bd5d-39d46fd658e0.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/209374400-3c486618-81ef-4d34-bd5d-39d46fd658e0.png\"></a><br><br>允许玩家为附魔物品选择附魔光效颜色。<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9296b230044bb4ef07851ff9baa2d04aeb210baee3467abafff1380fa081f08b/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4f6c31546366382e706e67\" alt=\"Fabric API\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchant-the-rainbow\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/f9d411270273580e5cecaa5077dbd66bebe9e118b7409f4e49fa676523805c1f/68747470733a2f2f63662e776179326d7563686e6f6973652e65752f66756c6c5f3535393132395f646f776e6c6f6164732e737667\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchant-the-rainbow\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/1dbd931af4da7bc14f3a21dc0524e6421499fc3d6e90f0e0243363cf19f892cc/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6d6f6472696e74682f64742f656e6368616e742d7468652d7261696e626f773f6c6162656c3d4d6f6472696e7468253230446f776e6c6f616473\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/717bce26f533bf1da7a6eec682015c3c93c5b026e5f40a394028f49d066ea57a/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f5065707065726f6e692d4a6162726f6e692f456e6368616e745468655261696e626f772f746f74616c3f6c6162656c3d446f776e6c6f616473266c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#-about\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📖&nbsp;关于</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>1 个新物品：“下界之星碎片”。</li>\n<li>4 个碎片可以通过将“下界之星”放入合成网格中分解成碎片来制作。</li>\n<li>使用铁砧将染料与碎片结合，为碎片染色。支持所有 16 种染料！</li>\n<li>将染色后的碎片与附魔物品结合，为附魔光效上色！</li>\n<li>符合游戏背景：信标光束的颜色可以通过原版中的染色玻璃改变，因此下界之星显然与颜色有某种互动。</li>\n<li>给你更多杀死凋灵的理由。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#-dependencies\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>⛓&nbsp;依赖</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>必需：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>可选：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#-changelog\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📃&nbsp;更新日志</h2>\n<p>更新日志可在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 发布页面</a>查看。</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#-media\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📸&nbsp;媒体</h2>\n&lt;details open=\"\"&gt;&lt;summary&gt;图片！&lt;/summary&gt;\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#overview-of-all-16-colors\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>所有 16 种颜色概览</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f146986901-1bb94711-f1e8-432a-baa7-5a255bb67df9.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/146986901-1bb94711-f1e8-432a-baa7-5a255bb67df9.png\" alt=\"2021-12-20_23 03 03\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#look-like-you-fell-in-some-paint\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>看起来你掉进了颜料里！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f146987288-58b2a62b-8d17-4090-ad52-fb0f97d5572e.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/146987288-58b2a62b-8d17-4090-ad52-fb0f97d5572e.png\" alt=\"2021-12-20_22 46 57\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#crafting-a-nether-star-fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>制作下界之星碎片</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f146987152-c3057469-4c64-4de3-b1ac-cb3be6a1ddd9.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/146987152-c3057469-4c64-4de3-b1ac-cb3be6a1ddd9.png\" alt=\"2021-12-20_23 03 28\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#coloring-a-nether-star-fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>为下界之星碎片染色</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f146987166-78728f5a-a0a4-4f6d-839a-bc4dd90fa729.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/146987166-78728f5a-a0a4-4f6d-839a-bc4dd90fa729.png\" alt=\"2021-12-20_23 03 58\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/EnchantTheRainbow/blob/main/README.md#coloring-an-items-glint\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>为物品的附魔光效上色</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f146987226-fc5e3efc-cb76-4232-8371-19f7152cab54.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/146987226-fc5e3efc-cb76-4232-8371-19f7152cab54.png\" alt=\"2021-12-20_23 04 17\"></a></p>\n&lt;/details&gt;</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
